<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Dashboard | Notehouse</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style1.css">
</head>
<body class="dashboard-page">
    <header class="dashboard-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">N</span> notehouse</a>
        <div class="dashboard-actions">
            <span class="status-pill"><span></span> Private space</span>
            <form action="/logout" method="POST">
                <button class="logout-button" type="submit">Log out</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main class="dashboard-main">
        <p class="eyebrow">Your workspace</p>
        <h1>Good to see you.</h1>
        <p class="dashboard-intro">Your notes and next ideas have a place to land.</p>
        <section class="welcome-card">
            <div class="welcome-icon" aria-hidden="true">N</div>
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">All set</p>
                <h2>Welcome to your dashboard</h2>
                <p>This is your private space. More thoughtful tools are on the way.</p>
                <a class="dashboard-link" href="/home">Open your notes &rarr;</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</body>
</html>